        "claim": "HasSupportedClaudeLifecycleState now also requires the new registry refresh hook. A settings file from a previous install, which had every other family and was reported supported, becomes unsupported until install-hooks is run again. Any caller that gates on this predicate (apply or sync gates, for example) will change its behaviour for existing installs. The diff does not show those callers, so the impact is unverified.",
